  "releaseNotes": "2.4.0 — Compliance Redaction Presets & Turnkey GitHub Action. Added StandardRedactorOptions.ForSecretsOnly(), ForPciDss(), ForGdpr(), and ForHipaa() presets, --preset CLI flag in Scrubkit.Tool, and root action.yml for CI/CD secret & PII scanning. Full changelog: https://github.com/jjopensoftworks-blip/Scrubkit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
